  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Cut the unpeeled potato into 1cm chunks. Crush or finely chop 1 garlic clove. Finely grate the parmesan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2619940/photos/large/136637_1-94a3fd96164b6415e36aa2a0eb4f2366.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake potato: Combine the garlic, half the Tuscan seasoning, 1 tbs olive oil and ½ tsp chilli flakes, if using, in a large bowl. Add the potato and toss to coat. Put on the lined tray and bake for 15-20 mins until golden and tender. Transfer the potato to a bowl, reserving the lined tray.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2619941/photos/large/136637_2-acb0ccc386f12938f1eea940e4d9a8df.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Put 2 pita on the reserved tray. Spread with the pesto, then scatter over the potato and half the parmesan. Bake the pizzas for 10-12 mins until golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2619942/photos/large/136637_3-099a4dee086eb4c3f5b24d82650584c8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make salad: Meanwhile, combine 2 tsp olive oil and 2 tsp balsamic vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the salad leaves and remaining parmesan and toss to coat (see Make it yours).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2619943/photos/large/136637_4-7e86a716c517b40e2d4f0dd1e44715cd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Cut the pizzas into wedges and divide among plates. Serve with the salad and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2619944/photos/large/136637_5-202d61741ea50cb5970bc371a98332b3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Feel free to toss in other salad goodies from your veggie drawer, such as cucumber, avocado or tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2619945/photos/large/136637_6-f7157b5e004047364e22238ac8b5ad9e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
